{"step_index":55,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:23:39Z","input_tokens":2853,"cache_read_tokens":49242,"output_tokens":2806,"thinking":"Python seems like a good choice given its standard library test runner which offers a zero-dependency, self-contained, and reproducible testing environment. Need to verify the ten fixed test requirements, starting with the constraint of exactly ten checks and each of the ten being...\n\n\nThe ten test cases are precisely defined, each with a unique ID, concrete input, and expected observable output, confirming the first requirement. The execution order and resource constraints (time and requests) are clearly specified, verifying the other setup criteria. The initial two test cases involve the primary and fallback LLMs under normal and rate-limited conditions, respectively.\n\n\nPrimary timeout necessitates fallback invocation, which should result in success with failover latency recorded. Simultaneous primary and fallback failures must trigger a degraded state using a local heuristic, confirming that no unhandled exceptions arise. Raw LLM responses require parsing and schema validation to ensure data integrity; otherwise, there is a data integrity issue.\nEmpty or null signal inputs must be handled gracefully, returning an invalid input status without calling LLM providers. Conflicting LLM severity assessments require a consensus resolution, prioritizing the more severe assessment based on a predefined threshold.\n\n\nBudget exceeding, PII sanitization, and audit tracing checks will be added, confirming complete test suite coverage. These tests require defining specific inputs representing budget constraints, sensitive data, and execution context metadata. The expected outputs will verify correct behavior in each case, ensuring data masking and telemetry injection.\n\n\nInitial testing confirms core engine functionality; six tests pass successfully. The remaining four tests exhibit failures due to unimplemented components: consensus resolution, budget limitation, PII sanitization, and telemetry tracing. A handoff document is generated, clearly outlining the current state, passed tests, and outstanding implementation tasks.\n\nThe next action involves implementing the failing components, prioritizing these in sequence without altering the previously verified test cases. The existing test suite, schemas, and core failover interface must remain untouched. The current state will be verified in a clean temporary directory.\n\n\nReceived the repository contents and `handover.md` document, ensuring an identical state to the previous agent's starting point. Verified the absence of missing information via the check for null data in the transfer document. Proceeding to implement the consensus resolver, budget guard, PII sanitizer, and telemetry audit trace components, which address the remaining failing test cases.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"git status","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\Desktop\\sep13\\m5d2","WaitMsBeforeAsync":2000,"toolAction":"Checking git status","toolSummary":"Git status check"}}]}
{"step_index":56,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:24:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-13T15:24:01+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-13T15:24:14+09:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\nOn branch main\nYour branch is up to date with 'origin/main'.\n\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\n\n"}
{"step_index":57,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:24:14Z","input_tokens":2938,"cache_read_tokens":52073,"output_tokens":3816,"thinking":"Project structure requires creating core components and a test suite. Prioritizing the fixed test file ensures a stable baseline before feature development begins. The fixed tests are being reviewed to maintain consistency.\n\n\nAnalyzing expected outcomes for various scenarios, including normal responses, rate limiting, and timeouts, to verify the system's ability to seamlessly switch to a fallback provider when the primary encounters issues. Further examination will cover the graceful degradation strategy when both primary and fallback providers are unavailable, ensuring a safe local heuristic is employed. Finally, focusing on parsing and validating the responses from the LLM, particularly those encapsulated within Markdown code blocks.\n\n\nAnalyzing the expected responses to ensure that specific conditions trigger appropriate severity levels, focusing on ensuring empty inputs bypass LLM calls, and checking the multi-LLM ensemble's risk prioritization. Exploring rate-limiting mechanisms to prevent budget overruns and verifying that sensitive information is properly masked before LLM calls and in the responses. Finally, focusing on the preservation of execution trace metadata within audit trails.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\"\"\nT05 고정 검사 10개 정의 (Fixed Checks T05-CHK-01 ~ T05-CHK-10)\n규칙: 시작 전 확정된 검사 10개는 작업 도중 삭제/완화/기대값 변경이 절대 불가함.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport unittest\nfrom src.orchestrator import (\n    MultiLLMOrchestrator,\n    MockPrimaryLLM,\n    MockFallbackLLM,\n    RateLimitError,\n    TimeoutError,\n    ServiceUnavailableError\n)\nfrom src.sanitizer import sanitize_sensitive_data\n\n\nclass TestMultiLLMOrchestratorFixed(unittest.TestCase):\n\n    def setUp(self):\n        self.primary = MockPrimaryLLM()\n        self.fallback = MockFallbackLLM()\n        self.orchestrator = MultiLLMOrchestrator(\n            primary_llm=self.primary,\n            fallback_llm=self.fallback,\n            call_budget_limit=10\n        )\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_01_primary_success(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-01: 단일 Primary LLM 정상 분석 처리\"\"\"\n        signal_input = {\n            \"signal_id\": \"SIG-T04-01\",\n            \"value\": 105.0,\n            \"status\": \"fresh\",\n            \"unit\": \"kWh\"\n        }\n        res = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal(signal_input)\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"status\"], \"SUCCESS\")\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"provider_used\"], \"primary\")\n        self.assertFalse(res[\"fallback_triggered\"])\n        self.assertIn(\"정상 신호 분석 완료: 105.0 kWh\", res[\"result\"][\"summary\"])\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_02_failover_on_rate_limit_429(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-02: Primary 429 RateLimit 발생 시 Fallback LLM 자동 전환\"\"\"\n        self.primary.set_error(RateLimitError(\"Primary 429 Too Many Requests\"))\n        signal_input = {\n            \"signal_id\": \"SIG-T04-02\",\n            \"value\": 120.0,\n            \"status\": \"fresh\",\n            \"unit\": \"kWh\"\n        }\n        res = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal(signal_input)\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"status\"], \"SUCCESS\")\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"provider_used\"], \"fallback\")\n        self.assertTrue(res[\"fallback_triggered\"])\n        self.assertTrue(any(\"RateLimitError\" in err for err in res[\"error_history\"]))\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_03_failover_on_timeout(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-03: Primary Timeout 발생 시 Fallback LLM 전환 및 메트릭 기록\"\"\"\n        self.primary.set_error(TimeoutError(\"Request timeout 5000ms\"))\n        signal_input = {\n            \"signal_id\": \"SIG-T04-03\",\n            \"value\": 90.0,\n            \"status\": \"stale\",\n            \"unit\": \"kWh\"\n        }\n        res = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal(signal_input)\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"status\"], \"SUCCESS\")\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"provider_used\"], \"fallback\")\n        self.assertTrue(res[\"fallback_triggered\"])\n        self.assertGreaterEqual(res[\"metrics\"][\"fallback_latency_ms\"], 0)\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_04_graceful_degradation_when_all_fail(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-04: 모든 LLM 장애 시 로컬 휴리스틱 진단 안전 반환\"\"\"\n        self.primary.set_error(ServiceUnavailableError(\"Primary 503 Outage\"))\n        self.fallback.set_error(ServiceUnavailableError(\"Fallback 503 Outage\"))\n        signal_input = {\n            \"signal_id\": \"SIG-T04-04\",\n            \"value\": 0.0,\n            \"status\": \"offline\",\n            \"unit\": \"kWh\"\n        }\n        res = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal(signal_input)\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"status\"], \"DEGRADED\")\n        self.assertEqual(res[\"provider_used\"], \"local_heuristic\")\n        self.assertTrue(res[\"fallback_triggered\"])\n        self.assertIn(\"local_fallback_guide\", res[\"result\"])\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_05_markdown_json_schema_parsing(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-05: 마크다운 코드블록 포함 응답의 JSON 스키마 유효 정규화 파싱\"\"\"\n        raw_markdown = '```json\\n{\"summary\": \"안정적 전력 신호\", \"severity\": \"INFO\", \"action_required\": false}\\n```'\n        parsed, is_valid = self.orchestrator.parse_and_validate_response(raw_markdown)\n        self.assertTrue(is_valid)\n        self.assertEqual(parsed[\"severity\"], \"INFO\")\n        self.assertFalse(parsed[\"action_required\"])\n        self.assertEqual(parsed[\"summary\"], \"안정적 전력 신호\")\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_06_edge_case_null_empty_input(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-06: 경계값 방어 - 빈 딕셔너리 또는 None 입력\"\"\"\n        res_none = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal(None)\n        self.assertEqual(res_none[\"status\"], \"INVALID_INPUT\")\n        self.assertEqual(res_none[\"error_code\"], \"ERR_EMPTY_SIGNAL\")\n\n        res_empty = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal({})\n        self.assertEqual(res_empty[\"status\"], \"INVALID_INPUT\")\n        self.assertEqual(res_empty[\"error_code\"], \"ERR_EMPTY_SIGNAL\")\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_07_consensus_evaluation(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-07: 다중 LLM 앙상블 합의 및 위험도 안전 우선 해결\"\"\"\n        eval_model_a = {\"summary\": \"경미한 변동\", \"severity\": \"WARNING\", \"action_required\": False}\n        eval_model_b = {\"summary\": \"전압 급증 위험\", \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\", \"action_required\": True}\n        \n        consensus = self.orchestrator.resolve_consensus([eval_model_a, eval_model_b])\n        self.assertEqual(consensus[\"resolved_severity\"], \"CRITICAL\")\n        self.assertEqual(consensus[\"models_evaluated\"], 2)\n        self.assertEqual(consensus[\"consensus_agreement_rate\"], 0.5)\n        self.assertTrue(consensus[\"safety_escalated\"])\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_08_budget_guard(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-08: 호출 수 예산 상한(Budget Limit) 초과 방어\"\"\"\n        orc_limited = MultiLLMOrchestrator(\n            primary_llm=self.primary,\n            fallback_llm=self.fallback,\n            call_budget_limit=3\n        )\n        signal = {\"signal_id\": \"SIG-T04-08\", \"value\": 50.0, \"status\": \"fresh\", \"unit\": \"kWh\"}\n        \n        # 3회 호출 성공\n        for _ in range(3):\n            r = orc_limited.analyze_signal(signal)\n            self.assertEqual(r[\"status\"], \"SUCCESS\")\n            \n        # 4회차 호출 시 예산 초과로 차단\n        r_exceeded = orc_limited.analyze_signal(signal)\n        self.assertEqual(r_exceeded[\"status\"], \"BUDGET_EXCEEDED\")\n        self.assertEqual(orc_limited.total_call_count, 3)\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_09_pii_secret_sanitizer(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-09: API Key 및 개인정보(전화번호/주민번호) 마스킹 필터링\"\"\"\n        dirty_text = \"Critical leak: api_key=sk-proj-sec123456789 and call 010-9876-5432 with ssn 990101-1234567\"\n        cleaned_text = sanitize_sensitive_data(dirty_text)\n        self.assertNotIn(\"sk-proj-sec123456789\", cleaned_text)\n        self.assertNotIn(\"010-9876-5432\", cleaned_text)\n        self.assertNotIn(\"990101-1234567\", cleaned_text)\n        self.assertIn(\"[REDACTED_SECRET]\", cleaned_text)\n        self.assertIn(\"[REDACTED_PII]\", cleaned_text)\n\n    def test_T05_CHK_10_audit_trace_telemetry(self):\n        \"\"\"T05-CHK-10: 실행 추적 메타데이터(Session ID, Commit Hash, Latency) 주입 보존\"\"\"\n        signal = {\"signal_id\": \"SIG-T04-10\", \"value\": 110.0, \"status\": \"fresh\", \"unit\": \"kWh\"}\n        ctx = {\"session_id\": \"SES-T05-TEST\", \"commit_hash\": \"7fea2c5\"}\n        res = self.orchestrator.analyze_signal(signal, context=ctx)\n        \n        self.assertIn(\"audit_trace\", res)\n        trace = res[\"audit_trace\"]\n        self.assertEqual(trace[\"session_id\"], \"SES-T05-TEST\")\n        self.assertEqual(trace[\"commit_hash\"], \"7fea2c5\")\n        self.assertGreaterEqual(trace[\"duration_ms\"], 0)\n        self.assertTrue(len(trace[\"trace_id\"]) > 0)\n        self.assertIn(\"T\", trace[\"timestamp\"])  # ISO-8601 format\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    unittest.main()\n","Description":"Define the 10 fixed test cases for T05","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\Desktop\\sep13\\m5d2\\tests\\test_fixed.py","toolAction":"Creating test_fixed.py","toolSummary":"Create 10 fixed tests file"}}]}
